title Cassette bound (CASSETTE_DEMO=1, CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD=speech): a speech headset that records at 16000 Hz only: the strip says 16k/16 WAV, Settings > Format says 16 kHz, a short take is listed
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_HOME demo-home
env CASSETTE_DEMO_CARD speech
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 1500
expect text "CARD"
expect text "SOFT"
shot speech-card
key s
wait 500
expect text "Record timer"
expect notext "Auto gain (card)"
shot speech-settings
key esc
wait 400
tap "REC"
wait 1800
shot speech-recording
tap "STOP"
wait 1000
key l
wait 600
expect text "Take 001"
shot speech-list
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
